<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>What Counts as Microlearning?</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset and Base Styles */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Slide Container */
        .slide-container {
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            position: relative;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Background Template */
        .shell {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Content Area */
        .content {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 2;
            padding: 120px 140px 280px 140px; /* Bottom padding protects footer/skyline */
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        /* Header Section */
        .header-section {
            margin-bottom: 90px;
            max-width: 1400px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 72px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0B1E36; /* Deep Navy */
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #334155; /* Slate Gray */
            line-height: 1.3;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        .citation {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #94A3B8;
            font-weight: 500;
            vertical-align: super;
            margin-left: 8px;
        }

        /* Definition Framework Grid */
        .framework-grid {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            width: 100%;
            flex: 1;
        }

        /* Individual Cards */
        .card {
            flex: 1;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(11, 30, 54, 0.04);
        }

        /* Card Top Accents */
        .card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -2px;
            left: -2px;
            right: -2px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
            background-color: #0B1E36; /* Default Navy */
        }

        .card.action-card::before {
            background-color: #D22730; /* SAEM Red for Actionable */
        }

        /* Icons */
        .icon-wrapper {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: #F1F5F9;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            color: #0057B8; /* SAEM Blue */
        }

        .action-card .icon-wrapper {
            background: #FEF2F2;
            color: #D22730; /* SAEM Red */
        }

        .icon-wrapper svg {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            stroke-width: 2.5;
        }

        /* Card Typography */
        .card h3 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0B1E36;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-transform: capitalize;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Subtle connecting line behind cards (optional structural element) */
        .connection-line {
            position: absolute;
            top: 450px; /* Align with icons */
            left: 180px;
            right: 180px;
            height: 2px;
            background: #E2E8F0;
            z-index: -1;
            border-style: dashed;
            border-width: 2px;
            border-color: #CBD5E1;
            background: none;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="slide-container">
        <!-- Required Background Image -->
        <img class="shell" src="../../../../templates/saem-annual-meeting-template-v1/template.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="content">

            <!-- Header -->
            <div class="header-section">
                <h1>What counts as microlearning?</h1>
                <h2>Brief, focused, high-yield learning episodes designed for action.<span class="citation">[1, 13, 27]</span></h2>
            </div>

            <!-- Framework Grid -->
            <div class="framework-grid">

                <!-- Card 1: Brief -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 15 15"></polyline>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>brief</h3>
                    <p>Short duration, typically 3–5 minutes. Designed to fit seamlessly into natural clinical workflow pauses.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2: Focused -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>focused</h3>
                    <p>Targets a single, specific learning objective per episode, eliminating all extraneous cognitive load.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3: Actionable -->
                <div class="card action-card">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>actionable</h3>
                    <p>Directly applicable to patient care. Built to drive immediate behavior change and clinical impact.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 4: Repeatable -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon-wrapper">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path>
                            <path d="M3 3v5h5"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3>repeatable</h3>
                    <p>Structured for spaced repetition and rapid retrieval exactly when needed at the point of care.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
